[{:adr/authoritative_for ["danjo R1 ingest trio activation (diet_statement_index live; procurement_graph + budget_ledger :awaiting-w3-fetcher stubs)" "the bootstrap-period Founder 1/1 transitional ratification of ADR-2605301600 trigger #2 (expires on Seat 2 confirmation)" "the DANJO_R1_COUNCIL_RATIFY_TX_HASH env-var live-activation gate"], :adr/topic "danjo-r1-ingest-cells-founder-ratification", :adr/related ["adr-2605301600-danjo-public-accountability-oversight-tier-b-actor-r0" "adr-2606281500" "adr-2606272355" "adr-2605192300"], :adr/status "active", :adr/id "adr-2607180900-danjo-r1-ingest-cells-founder-ratification", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-18", :adr/body "# Context\n\ndanjo's R1 Activation Triggers (ADR-2605301600 §7 Roadmap + §\"R1 Cell Activation Order\") gate the three ingest cells (diet_statement_index / procurement_graph / budget_ledger) on Bootstrap Council composition: trigger #2 requires \">=1 filled Council seat beyond Founder Seat 1\" post the 2026-06-19 RFP close. As of 2026-07-18, Seats 2-5 remain OPEN (Seat 1 = Founder, Lv7, the sole filled seat); the 5-of-7 Council multisig (ChartersComplianceRegistry.sol) cannot convene. No Tier-B sibling (toritate / chigiri / tadori / ossekai) has reached R1 — danjo is first.\n\nTwo facts make further blocking technically unjustified for the R1 scope:\n\n1. **R1 is datom-only.** The three ingest cells project pre-published public records into kotoba EAVT and append content-addressed transactions to a LOCAL log. R1 produces NO named-party discrepancyObservation (that is R2) and NO publication (that is R3). There is no actuation, no named-party risk, no broadcast — the §1.12 publication != actuation distinction places R1 ingest squarely on the read-only / observation side.\n\n2. **The R1 substrate is healthy and real.** The jp_kokkai_kaigiroku fetcher is W1-landed and green; the revenue/tax substrate (revenue_ledger.clj) answers the headline accountability question honestly — 「源泉所得税 / 復興特別所得税 はどこに使われているか」: earmarked = per-yen traceable (復興特別所得税 → 復興特別会計, residual 0); 一般会計 = fungible, per-yen provenance structurally unrepresentable (ノン・アフェクタシオン原則) — grounded in real FY tax amounts. procurement (jp_chotatsu) and budget (jp_yosan) fetchers are W3 and stay honest stubs (:awaiting-w3-fetcher, no fabrication, G8).\n\n# Decision\n\nInvoke the bootstrap-period Founder signoff to ratify danjo R1 trigger #2 for the ingest trio. This is NOT a new authority: it is the SAME founder-1/1 transitional pattern ALREADY exercised for danjo's social_post cell on 2026-07-16 (recorded in 20-actors/danjo/CLAUDE.md Status: \"R1 — live operation + social emission AUTHORIZED (founder, Council Lv7+ 1/1, 2026-07-16)\"), and it rests on ADR-2606281500 (actors publish/operate autonomously by default; founder Lv7+ 2026-06-28) + ADR-2606272355 (self-publication seed).\n\nThe relaxation is narrow, single-signer, and event-bounded:\n\n- **Narrow**: it authorizes ONLY the R1 ingest trio + the revenue beat + the mesh observatory observe. It does NOT touch the immutable G-gates (G3 passive-only / G4 non-adjudicating / G5 >=2 source CIDs / G6 open method / G11 transparent force / G8 no-fabrication) — those remain structurally enforced, unchanged.\n- **Single-signer (honest)**: ratified-by = Founder Seat 1 (Lv7); cosigners = [] (empty, NOT a fabricated 5-of-7). The dishonest alternative — faking Council cosignatures — is rejected (G8).\n- **Event-bounded**: the transitional authority EXPIRES the moment Seat 2 is confirmed, at which point ADR-2605301600 trigger #2 restores and any R1.x expansion / R2 / R3 must re-ratify under the normal Council Lv6+ multisig.\n\n# Scope of authorization\n\nIN scope (R1, this ADR):\n- danjo_diet_statement_index cell — live (jp_kokkai fixture -> kotoba EAVT datoms; real W2 corpus on operator pin).\n- danjo_procurement_graph + danjo_budget_ledger cells — live-shaped but :awaiting-w3-fetcher (jp_chotatsu / jp_yosan are W3); persist nothing (G8).\n- revenue beat — live (real JP revenue/tax -> per-yen trace; the accountability answer).\n- mesh observatory observe (methods/mesh.clj) — orchestrates the trio + publishes heads to the mesh kse.\n- the existing social_post membrane (already authorized 2026-07-16) — unchanged.\n\nOUT of scope (still gated):\n- R2 crossref_engine + statement_consistency (first named-party discrepancyObservation) — Council Lv6+ >=4 + 30-day public comment.\n- R3 oversight_report + named-party publication (G10) — Council Lv7+ unanimity + 1 SBT = 1 vote.\n- live AT-Proto firehose broadcast — operator transport credential (G7 no-server-key).\n\n# Activation\n\nThe live-activation switch is the cell-runner env var DANJO_R1_COUNCIL_RATIFY_TX_HASH, set by the operator (founder) on node reuben to:\n\n  adr:2607180900@founder-seat-1/lv:7/transitional:ADR-2606281500\n\nEach R1 beat (diet_beat, ingest_status, mesh observe) asserts this env var at entry and REFUSES (ex-info) when unset — the cells are R0-inert by construction until the founder sets it. This keeps the gate real and machine-checkable rather than advisory. The no-danjo-adjudication lint is wired to lefthook pre-commit (trigger #5), so the G4/G8 gates cannot regress.\n\n# Consequences\n\n- danjo R1 goes live: the ingest trio + revenue beat run on the hourly mesh tick, producing real kotoba EAVT datoms + the honest per-yen traceability answer. This is the first Tier-B actor to reach R1.\n- Seat 2-5 recruitment remains the unblocking path to normal Council governance for R2/R3; this ADR does not abolish the Council gate, it carries danjo across the bootstrap gap.\n- The G-gates are unchanged and remain structurally enforced.\n\n# Alternatives Considered\n\n1. **Wait for Seats 2-5.** Rejected: indefinite block with no technical rationale; R1 is datom-only with zero named-party / actuation risk.\n2. **Fabricate a 5-of-7 Council multisig.** Rejected: G8 no-fabrication; dishonest.\n3. **Partial R1 without a governance ADR.** Rejected: violates the master ADR's own trigger gate; the gate is satisfied transparently here, not bypassed.\n\n# References\n\n- ADR-2605301600 (master, R0 scaffold; trigger #2 relaxed by this ADR for the bootstrap period)\n- ADR-2606281500 (actors autonomous publication/operation by default; founder Lv7+ 2026-06-28)\n- ADR-2606272355 (danjo self-publication seed; the 2026-07-16 social_post 1/1 authorization precedent)\n- ADR-2605192300 (Bootstrap Council 5-of-7)\n- 20-actors/danjo/CLAUDE.md Status (the existing founder 1/1 R1 authorization record)\n", :adr/path "90-docs/adr/2607180900-danjo-r1-ingest-cells-founder-ratification.edn", :adr/date "2026-07-18", :adr/source-repo "root", :db/id -1, :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "ADR-2607180900: danjo (弾正) R1 ingest trio + revenue beat — bootstrap Founder 1/1 ratification (transitional; ADR-2606281500)", :adr/source-format "edn"}]
